# Stock Market Sentiment Analysis using Generative AI

## Overview

This project demonstrates how **Generative AI** and **Natural Language Processing (NLP)** can be used to analyze financial news and determine market sentiment. The objective is to classify stock-related news as **Positive**, **Negative**, or **Neutral**, helping investors and analysts better understand market trends and make informed decisions.

## Objectives

* Analyze financial news articles using Generative AI.
* Perform data preprocessing and exploratory data analysis (EDA).
* Generate sentiment labels from news content.
* Identify market trends and key insights from textual data.
* Demonstrate how AI-powered sentiment analysis can support investment decisions.

## Technologies Used

* Python
* Pandas
* NumPy
* Matplotlib
* Seaborn
* Generative AI (LLM)
* NLP Techniques
* Jupyter Notebook

## Project Workflow

1. Data Collection
2. Data Cleaning & Preprocessing
3. Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
4. Sentiment Analysis using Generative AI
5. Visualization of Results
6. Key Insights and Conclusion

## Features

* Financial news preprocessing
* AI-powered sentiment classification
* Data visualization and trend analysis
* Business insights from market sentiment
* Clean and well-documented Jupyter Notebook

## Business Value

Understanding investor sentiment from financial news helps organizations:

* Monitor market perception in real time.
* Detect bullish and bearish trends early.
* Support data-driven investment strategies.
* Reduce manual effort in analyzing large volumes of news articles.

## Future Improvements

* Real-time news scraping
